      "html" : "<\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-198781\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-198781\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div>A vent connector for low-heat appliances shall be a factory-built chimney section or steel pipe having resistance to heat and corrosion equivalent to that for the appropriate galvanized pipe as specified in <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '\/codes\/newyorkcity\/latest\/NYCadmin\/0-0-0-224733', hash: '#JD_FGCTable503.10.2.4' }}\">Table 503.10.2.4<\/Link>. Factory-built chimney sections shall be joined together in accordance with the chimney manufacturers' instructions. \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-198782\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-198782\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div><a name=\"JD_FGCTable503.10.2.4\" id=\"JD_FGCTable503.10.2.4\" title=\"FGC Table 503.10.2.4\"><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Table 503.10.2.4<br><\/br>Minimum Thickness for Galvanized Steel Vent Connectors for Low-Heat Appliances<\/span><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-198783\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-198783\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div style=\"margin-bottom=10pt\">&#160;<div class=\"xsl-table\">",
      "id" : "8474-html-1",
      "kind" : "html",
      "plainText" : "A vent connector for low-heat appliances shall be a factory-built chimney section or steel pipe having resistance to heat and corrosion equivalent to that for the appropriate galvanized pipe as specified in Table 503.10.2.4 . Factory-built chimney sections shall be joined together in accordance with the chimney manufacturers' instructions. \n\n Table 503.10.2.4\n Minimum Thickness for Galvanized Steel Vent Connectors for Low-Heat Appliances"
